# reserve-quorum — quorum reservation targets project verbatim in canonical form:
# m-of-n `<m> of {roles}` and conjunction `role and role`. Distinctness of the m parties
# is an implementation duty (separation of duty), not a language verdict.
actor a
gate decide risk high name approvals grant a
reserve loans by 2 of { legal, finance }
reserve audit by risk and legal
cord a -> decide
cord decide -> master
